SUMMARY:StockAI: 3-week window opens - 14 features awaiting outcome data
DESCRIPTION:This checkpoint was already scheduled before the 2026-09-08 ses
 sion and is the easy one to forget. The 2026-09-05 audit cycle deferred 14
  shipped features with an explicit "re-check 3-4 weeks" note. Window: 2026
 -09-25 to 2026-10-03. None need code - they need enough resolved outcomes 
 to judge.\n\nHIGHEST VALUE - ENTRY TIMING\nThe one genuinely weak componen
 t. A placebo test showed entering the same stocks 14 days earlier scored ~
 6 points better, root-caused to every conviction pillar being a momentum m
 easure. The non-momentum fix, check_prebreakout_alerts(), ALREADY EXISTS a
 nd only needed weeks of outcomes.\nCAREFUL: its earlier 0% win rate is NOT
  failure - effective sample was ~2-3, heavily clustered. Check the count b
 efore reading the rate.\nDO NOT re-derive the live-bar refactor or the ing
 estion speed-up; both consciously deferred, and the live-bar fix was forma
 lly vetoed as high regression risk against the fix that resolved the confi
 dence inversion.\n\nALSO IN THIS WINDOW\n- Anti-chase roc_10 filter: OOS s
 howed only +0.33 pts vs +1.6 in-sample. Confirm the ~17% BUY-block rate an
 d OOS gain hold live.\n- GEX corroboration (gamma_flip gate) and dark-pool
  relative threshold + persistence.\n\nGATED ON A COUNT, NOT THIS DATE - ch
 eck the count first and defer again if it has not moved:\n- Options-flow d
 irection logic: needs >=30 resolved outcomes PER DIRECTION.\n- Squeeze-fam
 ily short-interest corroboration: only ~107 alerts had fired total.\n- Con
 fidence-calibration feedback: several bands n<50, some n<10.\n- Squeeze ig
 nition tier: fired ZERO times ever; 4 rejection gauges now show why. Decis
 ion is loosen-or-retire, not rebuild.\n- Regime robustness: exactly 1 bear
  sample; gates any live-automation decision.\n\nRead the project_pending_d
 ata_verification memory (14 items) before writing code in any of these are
 as - its whole purpose is preventing re-proposed engineering on things onl
 y waiting on the calendar.\n\nFull checklist: https://claude.ai/code/artif
 act/f2462c2d-bde6-4f30-99d9-121ede27f411
